      p("The seismic catalog analysis cannot distinguish between natural multi-point fluid diffusion and multi-point injection from distributed sources because both produce similar broad spatial distributions. The depth ceiling finding is consistent with injection into the hydrothermal system but is also consistent with natural hydrothermal fluid accumulation confined to the upper crust. No single data point in the available evidence is individually conclusive."),

